# Performance

- Minimize JavaScript and avoid unnecessary hydration.
- Optimize images: correct dimensions, responsive `srcset`/`sizes` where appropriate, lazy-load non-critical images.
- Avoid third-party and animation libraries unless required.
- Keep CSS efficient; avoid render-blocking resources when possible.
- Preserve Core Web Vitals without sacrificing design fidelity.
